║  show options      → Show configurable parameters                          ║
║  set <OPT> <val>   → Set parameter (set RHOSTS 10.0.0.5)                  ║
║  setg <OPT> <val>  → Set GLOBAL parameter (setg LHOST 192.168.1.100)     ║
║  unset <OPT>       → Clear a parameter                                    ║
║  run / exploit     → Execute module                                        ║
║  back              → Return from module context                            ║
