║  workspace -a <n>  → Create workspace (workspace -a pentest_2026)          ║
║  workspace <n>     → Switch workspace                                      ║
║  workspace -d <n>  → Delete workspace                                      ║
║  db_nmap -sS -T4 <target> → Nmap + auto-import                            ║
