║  ps                → Process list                                          ║
║  migrate <PID>     → Move meterpreter to PID                               ║
║  shell             → Drop to cmd.exe / /bin/sh                            ║
║  upload <src> <dst>→ Upload file                                           ║
║  download <src> <dst>→ Download file                                       ║
